Well, you could always try to ascend with it. Stuff all the gold into a
bag of holding. You could put lots of gems and worthless artifacts and
other score-bumpers in there as well if you liked. Even in the BoH, all
that booty will still be inconveniently heavy, so nest the BoH into a
load of non-magic sacks (check spoilers, but I think the optimum number
is around 6 or 7) and then you will have a pretty good chance of
putting it safely into another bag of holding, thus reducing the weight
to something manageable. If the bag vapes- well, you've only lost a big
stash of gold. If it works, it will be an interesting litle quirk for
your YAAP.



